OL,3,GNEWSANewlyweds get lift from police    
OL,4,Aafter breakdown                        
OL,6,FTwo newlyweds got a lift to their      
OL,7,Fwedding reception in an unconventional 
OL,8,Fvehicle - a police car.                
OL,10,FAmy and Ben Smith were on the way to   
OL,11,Fcelebrate getting hitched in Lewes,    
OL,12,FEast Sussex when the vintage taxi they 
OL,13,Fwere travelling in broke down, leaving 
OL,14,Fthem stranded.                         
OL,16,FTwo officers on patrol stopped to      
OL,17,Fassist the cab, discovered the bride   
OL,18,Fand groom in their wedding finery, and 
OL,19,Foffered them a lift to their reception.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
