OL,3,GNEWSANewlyweds get lift from police    
OL,4,Aafter breakdown                        
OL,6,F"It was amazing and it definitely made 
OL,7,Fthe day," Amy said. "It couldn't have  
OL,8,Fbeen more perfect, to be honest."      
